<title>USA: Drypers Corp sells $115 mln 144A notes.</title>
<headline>Drypers Corp sells $115 mln 144A notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Drypers Corp was priced in the 144A private placement market on Tuesday via lead manager Prudential Securities Inc, according to a syndicate source.</p>
<p>Drypers is headquartered in Houston. It makes and markets disposable baby diapers and training pants under the Drypers brand name. It also produces lower-priced diapers and other brand names in the U.S. and internationally.</p>
<p>BORROWER DRYPERS CORP</p>
<p>AMT $115 MLN	 COUPON 10.25 PCT  MATURITY 6/15/2007</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 12/15/1997</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 10.25 PCT   PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>S&amp;P SINGLE-B				 CALLABLE NON-CALL FIVE</p>
<p>((U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212-859-1678))</p>
</text>
